        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Passage Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a  Passage Function Lever (Entry by Outside lever - Always unlocked)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200 Series Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-4200v-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-rim-exit-device-pdq-4200r-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Rim Exit Device</b></a>, \r\n Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-grade-2-surface-vertical-rod-door-panic-device-th1100edsvtbar\"><b>TH1100EDSVTBAR Surface Vertical Rod Panic Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-sh-08-phl\"><b>Classroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/night-latch-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-sh-09-phl\"><b>Night Latch Function Lever for Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware and instructions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-SH-14-PHL Passage Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage Function (ANSI F14) - Entry by Outside lever - Always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429LPNH.pdf?v=1704262275\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-SH-14-PHL Installation Template & Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
